    {
      "id": "JmSMW7pyzD63mYvfba_fs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2254.4327207244046,
      "y": -613.8374107567287,
      "width": 1053.83935546875,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bTc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 903046771,
      "version": 265,
      "versionNonce": 885921203,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785260329721,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "✅ This diagram reflects the current IAM structure defined in Terraform, including:\n\n- 4 IAM groups.\n\n- 10 IAM users.\n\n- AWS managed permission policies per group.\n\n- One custom MFA enforcement policy attached to every group.\n\n\n📝 Notes\n\n- `Force-MFA` is the custom IAM policy attached to every group, so all users must authenticate with MFA.\n\n- No permissions are assigned directly to users; all permissions flow through group membership.\n\n- Group names and user names are taken directly from `IaC/iam_groups.tf` and `IaC/iam_users.tf`.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "✅ This diagram reflects the current IAM structure defined in Terraform, including:\n\n- 4 IAM groups.\n\n- 10 IAM users.\n\n- AWS managed permission policies per group.\n\n- One custom MFA enforcement policy attached to every group.\n\n\n📝 Notes\n\n- `Force-MFA` is the custom IAM policy attached to every group, so all users must authenticate with MFA.\n\n- No permissions are assigned directly to users; all permissions flow through group membership.\n\n- Group names and user names are taken directly from `IaC/iam_groups.tf` and `IaC/iam_users.tf`.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
